WEBVTT

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:30.579
tungkol sa iyong mga karanasan,

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:34.412
ay magiging susi sa iyong tagumpay.

00:00:34.579 --> 00:00:37.329
[Ang Ating Pagtatrabaho]

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.829
[Taguyod ng Dropbox]

00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:42.787
Madalas tayong magduda 
sa mga alanganin na sitwasyon.

00:00:42.787 --> 00:00:45.079
Lalo na kung wala kang kasangga,

00:00:45.079 --> 00:00:46.787
ikaw palang ang nakapagtapos

00:00:46.787 --> 00:00:48.496
hindi ka sanay sa pinapasukan mo

00:00:48.496 --> 00:00:50.704
o kaya ikaw lang naiiba sa kanila.

00:00:50.704 --> 00:00:53.079
Alam ko ’yan, 
kasi naranasan ko na rin ’yan.

00:00:53.162 --> 00:00:55.746
Marami akong naranasan noon

00:00:55.746 --> 00:00:57.787
na akala ko'y paghihirap lang

00:00:57.787 --> 00:01:00.746
pero naging diskarte ko pala iyon.